<rml>
<head>
	<title>SoH3D RmlUi spike</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="rml.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="soh3d_test.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<div id="panel">
		<h1>RmlUi is live</h1>
		<p>This document is parsed from <span class="tag">.rml + .rcss</span> and
		rendered by the GL3 RenderInterface inside libultraship's Fast3D GUI pass.</p>
		<p>Styled colours, rounded corners and a drop shadow below:</p>
		<p>
			<span class="swatch a"></span>
			<span class="swatch b"></span>
			<span class="swatch c"></span>
		</p>
		<p>Phase 1 integration spike &mdash; render path verified.</p>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
